|  a  |<--(X)---+  b  +-------*-->|  =  |
+--+--+   a<-b  +-+---+       |    \___/
   |              |  ^        |
  (X) t<-a        |  |        |
   |              | (X) b<-t  |
   V              |  |       _V_
+-----+           |  |      /   \
|  t  +-------*---|--*-----|  <  |
+-----+       |   |         \___/
   ^          V   V
   |        ---------
  (X) t<-d   \  -  /
   |          --+--
   |            |
   +------------+


   start
     |
     V
    / \ yes            +-------+
+->< = >----> done     | t<-d  |<--+
|   \ /                +---+---+   |
|    | no                  |       |
|    |                     V       |
|    |   +------+         / \ no   |
|    +-->| t<-a +------->< < >-----+
|        +------+         \ /
|                          | yes
|      +-------------------+
|      V
|  +-------+
|  | a<-b  |
|  +---+---+
